00:27:53.539 --> 00:27:55.699
You can have a command-line-based interface.

00:27:55.819 --> 00:27:59.379
For this assignment, you only need to implement a command-line-based interface.

00:28:00.019 --> 00:28:02.959
So, command-line-based means you start a program from the command line.

00:28:03.419 --> 00:28:05.000
The program will print a prompt.

00:28:05.179 --> 00:28:08.079
