00:28:25.240 --> 00:28:31.299
So the application interface is only responsible with processing the command, the arguments of the command,

00:28:31.619 --> 00:28:38.900
and then calling a method from the layer below in order to implement the actual logic of the operation.

00:28:39.319 --> 00:28:42.139
So this takes us to the processing engine layer.

00:28:42.140 --> 00:28:49.600
The processing engine, or the processing layer, is responsible with implementing the actual logic of your application.

